silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_14_taxonomy_rdf_olog_seed_sections_01_taxonomy_source_leg_disambiguation_concrete_anchor_1_DMittens11#d_mittens_11 silm:hasLongDescription "The D_Mittens_11 is the page-11 source diagram indexing Mittens body-region, classification, evidence, validation legs. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'D_Mittens_11', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
